  "description": "✨ Bring a scoop of sweetness and a pop of fun to your creative projects with “Pudding Soda”—the ultimate Display Bubble Font!\nInspired by cozy cafes, fluffy desserts, and retro Japanese soda shops, this font features thick, chunky letterforms packed with playful personality. Each character is designed with cute “glossy reflection” details, making your text look instantly 3D, juicy, and irresistible.\nIt’s the perfect typeface for crafters, digital artists, and small business owners looking to add a friendly, eye-catching vibe to their branding.",
